{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And the work.</b> That was already done." "<b>The mem of די.</b> It returned to all the wise men." "<b>For all the work.</b> That they needed to make." "<b>And הותר.</b> A verb form; the sense is והותר — it left over."], :book "exodus", :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :zh-Hans, :chapter 36, :timestamp "2026-07-28T05:19:17.791542205Z", :translated-from :en, :model "glm-5.2"}